# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, build with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# dependencies
vendor/

# IDEs
.idea/

# goreleaser
dist/

# Agent instructions are versioned with the code. Re-included because a global
# ignore (~/.gitignore) excludes AGENTS.md everywhere; repo rules are read after
# the global one, so this negation wins. CLAUDE.md is a symlink to it and stays
# ignored.
!AGENTS.md
